{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1503066-books","id":1503066,"title":"$Books$","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-02-14T14:45:21-08:00","id":1503066,"title":"$Books$","content":"So I got an Amazon gift-card for Valentine's Day and I'm trying to find CoD books (not .PDFs; I despise .PDFs), like Requiem, 2nd Edition, but it's not coming up at Amazon (only Requiem, Aug 21st, 2004). There are hard-cover books right? I looked at Drivethru, and they had hard-cover. Nothing really 2nd edition. Am I doing something wrong?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-14T15:44:49-08:00","id":1503073,"title":"","content":"I'm not quite sure how you missed the hardcovers for Second Edition on DTRP (maybe you searched through White Wolf instead of Onyx Path?), but links for that are here:<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/123898/Vampire-The-Requiem-2nd-Edition?src=hottest_filtered\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: the Requiem</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/145541/Werewolf-the-Forsaken-2nd-Edition?src=hottest_filtered\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf: the Forsaken</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/181754/Mage-the-Awakening-2nd-Edition?src=hottest_filtered\" target=\"_blank\">Mage: the Awakening</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/189395/Promethean-the-Created-2nd-Edition?src=hottest_filtered\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean: the Created</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/248078/Changeling-the-Lost-Second-Edition?src=hottest_filtered\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: the Lost</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/369633/Hunter-The-Vigil-Second-Edition?src=hottest_filtered\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter: the Vigil</a>,<a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/272090/Geist-The-SinEaters-Second-Edition?src=hottest_filtered\" target=\"_blank\"> Geist: the Sin-Eaters</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/347148/Mummy-The-Curse-Second-Edition?src=hottest_filtered\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy: the Curse</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/124155/Demon-The-Descent?src=hottest_filtered\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: the Descent</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/162443/Beast-The-Primordial?src=hottest_filtered\" target=\"_blank\">Beast: the Primordial</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/341534/Deviant-The-Renegades?src=hottest_filtered\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant: the Renegades</a><br /> <br /> Amazon is kind of notoriously a pain in the ass to work with for reliable book selling of anything not DnD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-16T19:56:29-08:00","id":1503296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1503066-books?p=1503073#post1503073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Amazon is kind of notoriously a pain in the ass to work with for reliable book selling of anything not DnD.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I found it on Drivthru, so at least I know there's a hardcopy; but I just can't find it on Amazon. I'm also having browser issues; that's what I get for updating!<br /> <br /> I found something under Onyx Path.<br /> <br /> Edit: Vampire: Requiem 2nd E, unavailable; at least I actually found it! This is disappointing; when the local gaming-stores closed about ten-years ago, Amazon had tons of used RPG books at a low-price. Now, nothing. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":2521,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","user":"Iguazu","date":". 02-16-2023, 11:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-19T20:27:46-08:00","id":1503510,"title":"","content":"Like most rpg books nowadays the CofD stuff is print on demand. That means they aren't doing a large(ish) print run and then sending the books to distributers like they used to. Instead drivethrurpg has some really fancy printers that produce the book you want when you order it. As a result nobody else has the physical book, excepting the occasional second hand copy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4692-helel","name":"helel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"141"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-22T18:51:43-08:00","id":1503716,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>helel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1503066-books?p=1503510#post1503510\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Like most rpg books nowadays the CofD stuff is print on demand. That means they aren't doing a large(ish) print run and then sending the books to distributers like they used to. Instead drivethrurpg has some really fancy printers that produce the book you want when you order it. As a result nobody else has the physical book, excepting the occasional second hand copy.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's what I suspected. I like books, Kindle's OK.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-22T06:36:03-07:00","id":1506137,"title":"","content":"I recently learned that Vampire, Werewolf and Mage didn't have non-POD print books for second edition. The other game lines do though they can be very hard to find.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-29T19:48:10-07:00","id":1506917,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1503066-books?p=1506137#post1506137\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I recently learned that Vampire, Werewolf and Mage didn't have non-POD print books for second edition. The other game lines do though they can be very hard to find.</div> </div> </div> </div>Promethe